[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄さん。あの子のお父さんは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About that girl's father..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（漁師たちから聞いた、海を信仰するという集団は、\n\u3000生贄を捧げ、救いを求めると言っていたな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The fishermen mentioned a group that worships the sea. They said the group makes sacrifices to seek salvation.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あの娘の父親はその話を聞き、娘を病から救おうと\n\u3000魔物という生贄を捧げているんじゃないか？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What if her father heard about them and started offering monsters as sacrifices to save his daughter from her illness?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（たとえそれが今のような状況を生み、\n\u3000国を危険にさらしたとしても……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even if it's created this situation and put the nation in danger...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（娘のためには、やるしかなかったのかもしれない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe he felt he had no choice but to do it for his daughter.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……昔の俺もティムのためなら、\n\u3000犯罪に手を染めようがためらいはなかった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Back then... I wouldn't have hesitated to turn to crime if it meant saving Tim.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そんな俺が、あの娘の父親を捕まえる資格が\n\u3000あるんだろうか？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(So do I even have the right to apprehend that girl's father?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……兄さん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Are you okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前が元気になってくれて、本当によかったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm just really glad you got better."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ。いきなりどうしたの、兄さん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Where's this coming from?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あの頃は、多くの人々に迷惑をかけ、傷つけた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Back then, I caused trouble for so many people. I hurt them.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それでもあの頃がなかったら、ティムは今\n\u3000こうして元気にしていなかったかもしれない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But if I hadn't done what I did, Tim might not be here with me today, healthy and well.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だから、後悔はしていないが――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I don't regret it, but still...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティム。あの娘の父親は、もしかしたら――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ティム. That girl's father might be—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの子のお父さんが、この魔物の事件の犯人\nかもしれない……か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The one behind the monster incidents... right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。そうなのかもしれないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. It's possible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だったらさ。魔物の件も、あの子のお父さんが\n帰ってこない件も……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if that's true, then the monster problem and her father not coming home..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さんを見つけられたら、\nどっちの事件も解決できるんじゃないかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we find him, we could solve both issues, couldn't we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ああ……そうだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah... You're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから手掛かりを探しに、もう一度海辺へ行こうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So let's go back to the shore and look for clues."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、手掛かりなどどこにも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we don't have any leads to go on..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫だよ、兄さん。きっと見つかる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. I'm sure we'll find something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]